WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.957 --> 00:00:16.438
even Dr.

2
00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.298
Odd looked worried.

3
00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:20.741
"Rocket Girl, do you know anyone who can help us?"

4
00:00:21.241 --> 00:00:21.782
he asked.

5
00:00:22.742 --> 00:00:23.803
Roxy tapped her chin.

6
00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.585
"I think I do."

7
00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:28.886
She looked at Wukong and Cozlin.

8
00:00:29.587 --> 00:00:30.628
"Let's go to Earth!"

9
00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.181
Roxy opened her front door.

10
00:00:38.201 --> 00:00:40.483
"I'm home!"

11
00:00:42.325 --> 00:00:44.467
"Roxy!" her mom said.

12
00:00:44.487 --> 00:00:47.269
"I got your message.

13
00:00:47.469 --> 00:00:49.731
Are you done with your space mission?"

14
00:00:49.751 --> 00:00:52.734
"Not yet," Roxy said.

15
00:00:52.754 --> 00:00:57.538
"These are my friends, Kid Comet and Sun Wukong."

16
00:00:59.279 --> 00:01:00.880
Bippo climbed onto Roxy's head.

17
00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.302
"Bippo, me!"

18
00:01:03.322 --> 00:01:04.924
"Oh, right!"

19
00:01:06.084 --> 00:01:06.764
Roxy chuckled.

20
00:01:06.784 --> 00:01:08.025
"That's Bippo."

21
00:01:09.265 --> 00:01:10.225
Cozlin smiled.

22
00:01:10.245 --> 00:01:12.346
"Hello, Roxy's mom.

23
00:01:12.846 --> 00:01:14.066
I'm from Delkor."

24
00:01:15.187 --> 00:01:16.367
Wukong stepped forward.

25
00:01:16.387 --> 00:01:20.308
"If you need me to fight any demons, let me know."

26
00:01:20.328 --> 00:01:25.569
"Um, thanks," Roxy's mom said.

27
00:01:25.589 --> 00:01:30.911
"Would anyone like a snack?"

28
00:01:32.651 --> 00:01:34.792
Cozlin and Wukong followed her into the kitchen.

29
00:01:36.148 --> 00:01:37.249
Roxy opened her watch.

30
00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:41.213
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

31
00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:43.174
"Is everything okay?"

32
00:01:43.194 --> 00:01:45.516
"Yep," Roxy said.

33
00:01:45.536 --> 00:01:48.819
"Can you tell me how to find Professor Ditto?

34
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.983
I need someone who's an expert with computers and robots."

35
00:01:53.003 --> 00:01:57.407
"Oh, I guess you didn't hear," Mayor Bloom said.

36
00:01:57.427 --> 00:02:00.649
"Remember when you saw the 'real' Professor Ditto?"

37
00:02:00.669 --> 00:02:03.412
"Yes," Roxy said.

38
00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.681
"He retired from Metro City University."

39
00:02:06.702 --> 00:02:11.585
"Well, he was also a robot," Mayor Bloom said.

40
00:02:11.605 --> 00:02:16.268
"There is no real Professor Ditto—they were all robots!"

41
00:02:18.109 --> 00:02:18.990
Roxy was shocked.

42
00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:22.932
She said good-bye to Mayor Bloom and called Dr.

43
00:02:23.073 --> 00:02:29.157
Odd. "I was hoping to find Professor Ditto," Roxy said.

44
00:02:29.177 --> 00:02:32.519
"He's an expert with computers and robots.

45
00:02:32.659 --> 00:02:36.437
But I just found out that—" "You were looking for Professor Ditto?"

46
00:02:37.177 --> 00:02:38.117
Dr. Odd laughed.

47
00:02:38.857 --> 00:02:41.338
"You should have told me before you went to Earth.

48
00:02:42.578 --> 00:02:43.899
He wasn't a real person!

49
00:02:44.339 --> 00:02:45.119
I invented him.

50
00:02:45.439 --> 00:02:46.759
He was one of my robots!"

51
00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.660
Roxy was now even more shocked.

52
00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:54.142
"What?" "It was an experiment," Dr.

53
00:02:54.242 --> 00:02:54.722
Odd said.

54
00:02:54.742 --> 00:02:57.803
"I wanted to make a robot that could grow old.

55
00:02:58.263 --> 00:02:58.703
It worked!"

56
00:02:59.603 --> 00:03:02.744
"Ugh!" Roxy said.

57
00:03:04.072 --> 00:03:06.854
"I don't know any other computer or robot experts."

58
00:03:08.034 --> 00:03:09.675
"We don't need an expert," Dr.

59
00:03:09.755 --> 00:03:10.256
Odd said.

60
00:03:10.276 --> 00:03:13.177
"We just need someone who can get to the computer.

61
00:03:14.358 --> 00:03:21.142
The person just has to type in a code and press a few "Ahh!

62
00:03:21.182 --> 00:03:21.702
A tiger!"

63
00:03:22.082 --> 00:03:23.763
Roxy's mom suddenly screamed.

64
00:03:23.783 --> 00:03:25.424
"I have to go!"

65
00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:28.706
Roxy closed her watch and ran into the kitchen.

66
00:03:30.487 --> 00:03:32.108
Her mom was backed into a corner.

67
00:03:33.128 --> 00:03:34.890
A huge tiger sat in front of her.

68
00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.752
It quickly transformed into Wukong.

69
00:03:37.772 --> 00:03:41.675
"Sorry!" the monkey said.

70
00:03:41.695 --> 00:03:45.539
"I was telling Kid Comet about a tiger demon I once fought.

71
00:03:46.299 --> 00:03:48.841
She asked what a tiger was, so I showed her."

72
00:03:51.043 --> 00:03:51.804
He looked around.

73
00:03:51.824 --> 00:03:53.545
"Where did she go?"

74
00:03:55.287 --> 00:03:57.188
Shloomp! Cozlin stepped through the wall.

75
00:03:57.208 --> 00:04:01.332
"Ahh!" Roxy's mom screamed again.

76
00:04:02.932 --> 00:04:04.694
"Here I am," Cozlin said.

77
00:04:04.714 --> 00:04:08.797
"You scared me, Wukong!"

78
00:04:08.877 --> 00:04:10.439
Bippo pointed at Roxy's mom.

79
00:04:10.459 --> 00:04:14.442
"Scared, you!"

80
00:04:14.602 --> 00:04:16.644
Roxy sighed and took her friends outside.

81
00:04:19.026 --> 00:04:20.887
Then she told them about Professor Ditto.

82
00:04:25.691 --> 00:04:27.033
worry," Roxy said.

83
00:04:27.053 --> 00:04:30.776
"I have one more person I can call."

84
00:04:33.324 --> 00:04:34.025
Jack yawned.

85
00:04:34.045 --> 00:04:38.989
"This Mighty Man episode is boring."

86
00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:40.990
Mara nodded.

87
00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.932
"It stinks!"

88
00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:46.735
Jack, Mara, and Terrell were watching TV at Jack's house.

89
00:04:48.176 --> 00:04:49.097
Terrell's phone beeped.

90
00:04:51.659 --> 00:04:54.541
"I'll be right back."

91
00:04:55.342 --> 00:04:56.263
He went into the kitchen.

92
00:04:56.283 --> 00:04:59.626
"Roxy?" he whispered.

93
00:05:00.486 --> 00:05:02.348
He listened for a moment as Roxy talked.

94
00:05:02.892 --> 00:05:04.194
His eyes went wide.

95
00:05:05.115 --> 00:05:06.617
Then his jaw dropped open.

96
00:05:06.637 --> 00:05:08.138
"Don't worry.

97
00:05:08.479 --> 00:05:09.300
I'm on my way!"
